            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:2e7fbc9d2b336980a65452d68d4a43a5b4eb9922c3118b672102a588479d3ac6"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "中微公司基于在半导体制造设备产业多年积累的专业技术，涉足半导体集成电路制造、先进封装、LED生产、MEMS制造以及其他微观工艺的高端设备领域，瞄准世界科技前沿并坚持自主创新。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c2",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:fbb1a0546e8ad43e2ca4e2a78e03f6cf950cf55228992685bf46bf554ed1d7fd",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:b0999610d764d70dcb9ef0ead5251206ba6f08790387b01b7d83cc25b7d98d3e",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:aa06c4f6d0d0c96cf582c9bd47e45c81e7f0cdd2cd48d5ac5d7bb70148076987",
