            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:1b3cc2257e4e627f7ccb9f7b8bd1547a8340527f803f2c8d3f58798c481a2859",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:e84a6151e80dd3e99ed7167b4489efeabd5239d020639ba1c809cc3c925b19c3"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司的等离子体刻蚀设备已在国际一线客户从65纳米到14纳米、7纳米和5纳米的集成电路加工制造及先进封装中有具体应用。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c3",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:fee3bd0d3d187df4de31fcc7554d0827d6c33be8002c61802c76e5f96714dcd6",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:c5073f06a3daca767799d5b9c5df7c0c44e0949bf6d8400383afe4451c29b92a",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:e05d9388f046e5bd2a870c32a4c7c069d2d0cbf7f31f97693145f30c02f44cfe",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:61adc9fe0114d665f08ee943cd32afef5895f9c53ee7ff4c5981c385867a8740"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司的MOCVD设备在行业领先客户的生产线上大规模投入量产，公司已成为世界排名前列、国内占领先地位的氮化镓基LED设备制造商。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c4",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:3494703cf0cf5ba7294596b6724f9a47efaec17aaea72846cae9cc7c17bc6847",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:2f94bb9562f222aec1f0a53c48d397a9a8e9ef84b22bd5663eee0940492547d9"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "MOCVD设备市场有广阔的增长空间，包括红黄光LED、紫外光LED、功率器件和正在推动显示技术革命的Mini LED、Micro LED等。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c5",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:c65dbd14805e63dda9eb90c1c645ca4fd4fb70535a2e785bbf075e462a6b7868"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司的等离子体刻蚀设备通过采用双反应台技术增加了产能输出，有效降低客户成本。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c6",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:b70b369b024354a66057b1bf4870df44ad1ce5d6f5f90eb533de1a577b1ccfa7",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:29643d428330e6ebae8e5ad19291bebb176d834bb8e6fef2830c68eec13250d4",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:246015474cf30e3037ef68f7be035e494dfbb1f0886835609587b6c807211e16",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:a6fec4b60d30d636efc9a868aa19dfd693b99bf59b172ebd2f4445868297cbde"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司的MOCVD设备Prismo A7可配置多达4个反应腔，可以同时加工136片4英寸晶片或56片6英寸晶片，工艺能力还能延展到生长8英寸外延晶片；每个反应腔都可独立控制，这一设计可以实现卓越的生产灵活性，有效提高客户的生产效率。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c7",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:eadfc7b04b9bf4cd019dc50f309b302ec80afde40faeb6dbbb0fdee58afe34dd",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:0c7d2b77a102cf2c9a669fc42d3c57f97bbdc7d18d1ff55044f53bd6f83934e9"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "报告期内，公司的深硅刻蚀设备的累计产量和销量分别为14腔、10腔，已实现量产。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c8",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
