          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司主要采用以销定产的生产模式，生产经营的核心在于产品的研发、设计、供应链管理、销售以及售后服务等环节，并主要通过直销方式为客户提供产品和服务。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c10",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:34140996f3305f138c42404bd7eb0fee9aca36e9db20f02188fa8dc3ebe270d1",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:bad5dfe4df28401ac123f8cce27f52ae4bce805211ca74e5c14f4a7808d4ccfe"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司的销售市场覆盖中国台湾、韩国等海外地区，境外市场的开拓和维护导致销售费用较高。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c11",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:95afe1bce0914734186dff4c899e71656fe441d5642c5b0c85b8ca5262e9ec29"
          ],
          "modality": "planned",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司将继续通过自主研发进一步提高公司产品的竞争力，为客户提供品质服务。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c12",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
