          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "在概念与可行性阶段，公司针对行业技术动态或市场需求来设定新产品定位与构想，确定最适合客户需求的研发方案，并按照市场需求规范的要求。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c14",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:f888a821b65577f4a0e8d886897baff90d542f09ca4f8b78370fd84cba4b8c03",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:4c2856015cf7fc2e5db1ce80550af9d46e8a4539c172ed450589a8234dc1bcaa"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "报告期内，公司承担了多项与公司刻蚀技术、MOCVD技术等核心技术相关的科研项目，科研内容主要为刻蚀设备研发、MOCVD设备研发等。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c15",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:c11c902c88f304782a5df5652877e7ad1cdcfe41a59b71d011f3720b5354b255",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:3750429292cc0e765c0cd2d6c540738655682c6b29d35dbc39111f1c635de675",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:8988d86a192f418582858ffad1dea1b63acd6d6c4f8f74ce53e609d878ad936d"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "报告期内，公司主要承担的国家重大专项等科研项目与《“十三五”国家科技创新规划》中提出的内容相符，公司承担的科研项目符合国家科技创新规划。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c16",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:e899482f553b1cfded64b183239096a1db38282470f3def9735b0c539623e531",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:4521508de4a477175f9e35879173d5832e9ad9762e19c3484bddd0a1701ff283",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:2ac902593453cf47349ca4b402ad3717f9f87d62b017d562b71c2adc38c1fe3d",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:4cdab67616e1f13d7fa06b5f7acf30111a46c0d3f91098b55af7b5bef2a711c1",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:0e384a1a115f0f76d64ef9f8b0c4e7ad28382aee2d93d74e0d9cda48eb356c84",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:46b514cd032966f6d9f8aba20c9d4010945e81988705d41e9e98ee02893f7c73"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "相关政策提出应重点突破LED外延生长和芯片制造关键技术，提高外延片和高端芯片的国内保障水平；增强功率型LED器件封装能力，加大对封装结构设计、新型封装材料及新工艺的研究与开发；加快实现金属有机化合物化学气相淀积设备的量产，推进衬底材料、高纯等。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c17",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:712bc3d06b2c5787b3c1cf20c4af5ee2e335704ee8676bdf570d521f7b3ac849",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:1d6238af23409eef4a8b0bf1d5c85c0ef2385df489428d5d9e2657dccf3d4f56",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:d6271fac590ce9d5a2428bcfaa9b095b17f6dc51f5155e352772d87dffef3679",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:07139ff97eff8cb8906466774b31529be4c6bc0387e3963930662bc2db0d8606",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:171b2582b2e3cc97532919a696a9e3b07ce816f8875ae52aa20f0428ec3858af"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "相关政策提出“大型MOCVD装备、关键原材料实现国产化，检测设备国产化率达70%以上；建立具有世界先进水平的研发、检测平台和标准、认证体系”的发展目标。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c18",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:7c56072c39e44a1b3252cec717f49271a5826ecaf2aa8d611e8442509bdd042f",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:04f39ea4f9c9710cd84940be4c8a670672c52fda8b0a12358a339d4863115526",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:74f9407a71cc76beec9b949e169ed140e7a93881b10ba3a7dac8a463a03d85af"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "相关政策将“着力推进核心装备的引进消化吸收和再创新，力争实现生产型MOCVD设备量产”作为重点任务推动。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c19",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:c646199fa84e5e7706cfc47689868cd0ddd0fc68d6bd07cd7229e1e135626056",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:5f45db0f5e3f8f3f82a23bb6a967d4f5686831c93a00bf4607cc2e920a2812c8"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "专用设备产品进入市场需要经历较长的验证过程，往往需要相当长的时间才能通过下游企业的工艺验证。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c20",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:d165c5f51bb884ac78b27b3cf02e9deca695a5f3882d9559a3ec9a53ed005725",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:5b3eb0bde7fafd9804cb57ba5418143926078c60a3da2ac8401722f659bd689f",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:22d66b70dfc464c6e26d70346389fb9d2418ecc8c2bdcfc71c304c91a49322e9"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司视情况需要将机台在客户端开始小批量验证；本阶段的成功完成意味着技术开发已经成熟、机台开发成功，Beta机可进入量产阶段。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c21",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:42c60629b73f2fe0a2accd74e1c5b2bcc0580e464f0eac06703412772acc63a8",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:1813607c54058b7c87a1d58991f7b00e05e68e6607bd7174753a01e3624f23c5",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:5917d177fb98b5a7ac0d6bafbf6f8503cbb88b31b552440b40726a78ce63b1fc",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:7d549d3cff0b836bb3c177a7d7b64045f9385ee913e871482943f67a77620e56",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:68e59c4cd615a7453d1d50982af41952caaa505072185f2468769fd33a4083a7"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "全球营销中心及各区域销售部门首先会聘请专业机构对新客户进行终端使用者认证；在确认符合相关国家或地区进出口管制规定后，公司对客户进行调研，营销中心负责与客户洽谈销售合同的相关条款，同时技术部负责与客户洽谈产品技术条款，确认无误后双方签订合同。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c22",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:c6ebbde8e351874b14fc82d120a0d5c436768588ac6020a46973c74c7644cedf",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:31d7e9e32d2ebf0700bcd698308777c2c2b566f79f751d36aa3409e071b29df7",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:841fb50299f381259bd08329618870c4433635e4f762badc4d14e78648eaa995",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:2ad74155dfb666885ce99b24658502cedd9e72f3e1911188197bc3bcb5491397",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:5ac0b62bf900a8a2305e9f668e216ea0165692eff7ff9a90ccae0c34409cda85"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司采用以销定产的业务模式，主要生产资料是原材料、人工及检测组装设备；原材料供应渠道较多，公司与合格原材料供应商建立了稳定的合作关系，原材料不会成为公司的产能瓶颈。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c23",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:cc5142b3587e76e8f55a0e4e2e72d25e7d4e941d12fe4aef711db177769a9ed9",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:04a7384b9212f713bb6d8a6eb00763f54f8c1fd37c058fcd758d57af701d0bc5",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:615e5e360cbe4e48e6fba0300dd55dab9ecd05998908baa2bbe0aca17de12e1c",
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:ea16998485c82c8c03bd7963d389e230aad4a3a2f35dd75265c6cbf8bf5cdb99"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司生产过程先组装模块再组装整机，生产过程较为简单，培训上岗较快，外部劳动力市场供应充足，公司也可根据实际订单灵活调整工人数量，人工亦不会成为限制公司生产能力的主要因素。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c24",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:11fc2457d6e9510d5c8da39a65aa71b28b84992f91ec0aa8fafbcdf6ddaf3df7"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "本次重组新增的业务是境外的销售扩展、客户维护及售后管理等。"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "c25",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:17c726a96540a49579db1bc43dc1a197d845125231bc1b1f7209f2e47e9cb751"
          ],
          "modality": "planned",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "公司大力拓展现有业务，开拓新市场和新领域。"
        }
      ],
      "replay_status": "verified"
    },
